.TH DIFFUSION_CONVERT 1 "2026-06-29" "Symoneural" "Symoneural Helper Utilities"
.SH NAME
diffusion_convert \- convert .safetensors diffusion checkpoints to GGUF
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B python helpers/python/diffusion_convert.py convert
.I src
.I dst
.RB [ \-\-type
.IR QUANT ]
.RB [ \-\-bin
.IR PATH ]
.PP
.B python helpers/python/diffusion_convert.py batch
.I src_dir
.I dst_dir
.RB [ \-\-type
.IR QUANT ]
.RB [ \-\-bin
.IR PATH ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B diffusion_convert.py
wraps the
.B stable-diffusion.cpp
command-line binary to convert diffusion model weights from
.I .safetensors
format to GGUF with optional quantisation.
.PP
The
.B convert
sub-command handles a single file.
The
.B batch
sub-command converts all
.I .safetensors
files in a directory.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B convert \fIsrc\fR \fIdst\fR [\-\-type \fIQUANT\fR] [\-\-bin \fIPATH\fR]
Convert
.I src
to
.I dst
using quantisation type
.I QUANT
(default:
.BR f16 ).
.TP
.B batch \fIsrc_dir\fR \fIdst_dir\fR [\-\-type \fIQUANT\fR] [\-\-bin \fIPATH\fR]
Convert every
.I .safetensors
file in
.I src_dir
and write GGUF outputs to
.IR dst_dir .
Exits with code 1 if any conversion fails.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-type \fIQUANT\fR
Quantisation type flag passed to the
.B sd
binary.  Common values: 
.BR f32 ", " f16 ", " q8_0 ", " q4_0 .
Default:
.BR f16 .
.TP
.B \-\-bin \fIPATH\fR
Override the path to the
.B sd
binary.  By default the binary is expected at
.IR converters/diffusers_cpp/build/bin/sd .
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
Single conversion:
.RS
.EX
python helpers/python/diffusion_convert.py convert sd-v1-5.safetensors sd-v1-5.gguf \-\-type f16
.EE
.RE
.PP
Batch conversion at Q8:
.RS
.EX
python helpers/python/diffusion_convert.py batch ./raw_models/ ./converted/ \-\-type q8_0
.EE
.RE
.SH FILES
.TP
.I converters/diffusers_cpp/
stable-diffusion.cpp git submodule.  Build with:
.BR "cmake -B converters/diffusers_cpp/build -S converters/diffusers_cpp && cmake --build converters/diffusers_cpp/build -j" .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR gguf_inspect (1),
.BR quant_utils (1)
.SH AUTHORS
Symoneural contributors.
